# 自动换行归一（跨平台协作，检出时按平台转换）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本统一 LF，bat 保持 CRLF
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源（避免被当作文本处理导致损坏）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pyd binary
*.so binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
